# Expansion Plan: XP, Notes, and Map Features

This plan outlines the activation of core interactive features: a gamified XP system, a persistent Notes (Diary) module, and an interactive Map for location-based safety and exploration.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Map Provider**: I will use OpenStreetMap via `flutter_map` which is **FREE** and does not require a billing setup or API key like Google Maps.
> **XP Logic**: I propose 10 XP per message and 50 XP per completed task. Do you want to adjust these rates?

